# Files in the supabase folder that Git should not track.
# (How these patterns work: see the comments in the .gitignore file in the
# project's top folder.)

# Files the Supabase CLI writes on your computer, for example which project
# this folder is linked to (npx supabase link). They are re-created as needed.
.branches
.temp

# A .env file in this folder can hold secret keys for the Edge Functions when
# they run on your computer. The real secrets live on Supabase
# (npx supabase secrets set).
.env
